      "writtenOn": "2026-01-29T20:56:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a little concerned with the `led_pattern` pointer being defined in a function and falling out of the stack. So when the scheduled work occurs, this pointer is invalid.",
      "revId": "8062f20254d66db9d8334e5d03341064bba17231",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
