        "id": 1000407
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-29T21:46:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The API requires that the data remains valid until execution completes. This test simply allocates the data on the stack, which is safe as the test waits for the execution to finish within this function scope. Defining this data in a helper function would not, as the stack frame would be invalidated upon return.",
      "parentUuid": "5b57a2a1_1e4f7814",
